sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(via Gateway/Service)
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Upstream as Upstream Application<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Authenticated Request Proxying

    Client->>KRP: HTTPS/8443<br/>Bearer Token or OIDC JWT or client cert
    activate KRP
    Note over KRP: Path filter check<br/>(--ignore-paths bypass)
    Note over KRP: AuthN: TokenReview / OIDC / X.509

    KRP->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: TokenReview response<br/>(user identity, groups)

    Note over KRP: AuthZ chain evaluation:<br/>1. Hardcoded metrics authorizer<br/>2. Static authorizer<br/>3. SAR authorizer

    KRP->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: SubjectAccessReview response<br/>(allowed: true/false)

    alt Authorized
        KRP->>Upstream: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>Forwarded request (no auth)
        Upstream-->>KRP: HTTP response
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS/8443<br/>Proxied response
    else Denied
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS/8443<br/>403 Forbidden
    end
    deactivate KRP

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Prometheus Metrics Scraping (Hardcoded Allow)

    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)<br/>prometheus-k8s SA

    Prom->>KRP: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, SA Token
    activate KRP
    Note over KRP: AuthN: TokenReview identifies<br/>system:serviceaccount:<br/>openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s

    KRP->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>HTTPS/443
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: TokenReview response

    Note over KRP: Hardcoded metrics authorizer:<br/>ALLOW (prometheus-k8s SA at /metrics)
    Note over KRP: SAR check skipped

    KRP->>Upstream: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)
    Upstream-->>KRP: Metrics response
    KRP-->>Prom: HTTPS/8443<br/>Prometheus metrics
    deactivate KRP
